author=Codex
summary=Stabilizes vendor.fps_hal startup for GSIs and patches fingerprint SELinux denials.
description=Waits for TEE/SPI nodes, repeatedly restarts vendor.fps_hal via ctl.start, keeps GSI fingerprint feature flags, and applies sepolicy rules for hal_fingerprint_* THP reads.
